  "question": {
    "text": "In the circuit shown below, the ac source has voltage $V=20 \\cos (\\omega t)$ volt with $\\omega=2000 \\mathrm{rad} / \\mathrm{s}$\r\n\r\nThe amplitude of the current will be nearest to\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/0sMCMm8Dj6GVncaD-q5TZfNMH0aQT3lyO35PZhANVqc.original.fullsize.png\">",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "FFWd9",
      "text": "$2 \\mathrm{~A}$",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "G8X7t",
      "text": "$3.3 \\mathrm{~A}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ohnxo",
      "text": "$2 / \\sqrt{5} \\mathrm{~A}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "tnsZL",
      "text": "$\\sqrt{5} \\mathrm{~A}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\r\n\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n\r\nZ=& \\sqrt{R^{2}+\\left(\\omega L-\\frac{1}{\\omega C}\\right)^{2}} \\\\\r\n\r\n&=\\sqrt{10^{2}+\\left(2000 \\times 5 \\times 10^{3}-\\frac{1}{2000 \\times 50 \\times 10^{-6}}\\right)^{2}} \\\\\r\n\r\n=& 10 \\Omega \\\\\r\n\r\n\\quad i=\\frac{V_{0}}{Z}=\\frac{20}{10}=2 A .\r\n\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n\r\n$$",
